 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »edgeControl« </h3> <h1> Detects tool breakage on all cutting edges </h1>",
   "body": "<p><strong>Do you want to deliver 100% quality to your customer and/or resharpen efficiently and therefore need to detect chipping or wear on tool cutting edges quickly and precisely?</strong></p> <p>The ZOLLER »edgeControl« with 3D sensor takes on this demanding task for you. The sensor is aligned fully automatically to the cutting edge and the cutting edges are digitized in 3D, including simultaneous path control of the axes. The subsequent analysis of the 3D model is also fully automatic and can be influenced manually if required.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/company/contact-us\">Inquire now</a></p>",
